# Same-origin contract (P4a):
# - DEV: leave empty. The Vite dev proxy (vite.config.ts) forwards /jobs,
#   /rosters, /masters, /master-sets, /auth, /archives to the FastAPI backend
#   on :8000, so relative paths work in the browser.
# - PROD: leave empty TOO. After `npm run build`, FastAPI serves frontend/dist
#   AND the API from one process (set SHIFT_FRONTEND_DIST=.../frontend/dist).
#   Same origin -> no CORS, cookies flow automatically. Only set an absolute
#   origin here for the unusual case of a separately-hosted API.
VITE_API_BASE=
